  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Now let's convert that counting idea into code.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 2700,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 81,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "We need three counters.",
      "start_ms": 3680,
      "end_ms": 4980,
      "start_frame": 110,
      "end_frame": 149,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "Count 0, count 1 and count 2.",
      "start_ms": 5540,
      "end_ms": 9020,
      "start_frame": 166,
      "end_frame": 271,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Initially, all three are 0.",
      "start_ms": 9400,
      "end_ms": 11740,
      "start_frame": 282,
      "end_frame": 352,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Then we scan the array once.",
      "start_ms": 12220,
      "end_ms": 14300,
      "start_frame": 367,
      "end_frame": 429,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "If the current value is 0, increase count 0.",
      "start_ms": 15020,
      "end_ms": 18320,
      "start_frame": 451,
      "end_frame": 550,
      "word_count": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "If it is 1, increase count 1.",
      "start_ms": 18760,
      "end_ms": 21560,
      "start_frame": 563,
      "end_frame": 647,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Otherwise, it must be 2.",
      "start_ms": 21820,
      "end_ms": 23560,
      "start_frame": 655,
      "end_frame": 707,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "So increase count 2.",
      "start_ms": 24100,
      "end_ms": 25700,
      "start_frame": 723,
      "end_frame": 771,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "After this first pass, we know exactly how many 0s, how many 1s, and how many 2s are present.",
      "start_ms": 25700,
      "end_ms": 34040,
      "start_frame": 771,
      "end_frame": 1021,
      "word_count": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Now we rewrite the same array, start from index 0.",
      "start_ms": 34780,
      "end_ms": 38360,
      "start_frame": 1043,
      "end_frame": 1151,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "First, write 0, count 0 times.",
      "start_ms": 38880,
      "end_ms": 42380,
      "start_frame": 1166,
      "end_frame": 1271,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Then write 1, count 1 times.",
      "start_ms": 42900,
      "end_ms": 45780,
      "start_frame": 1287,
      "end_frame": 1373,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "And finally, write 2, count 2 times.",
      "start_ms": 46280,
      "end_ms": 49660,
      "start_frame": 1388,
      "end_frame": 1490,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "That gives us the sorted array.",
      "start_ms": 50260,
      "end_ms": 52000,
      "start_frame": 1508,
      "end_frame": 1560,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "For our example, count 0 is 3, count 1 is 3, and count 2 is 4.",
      "start_ms": 52000,
      "end_ms": 58640,
      "start_frame": 1560,
      "end_frame": 1759,
      "word_count": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "So we write 3 0s, 3 1s, and 4 2s.",
      "start_ms": 59040,
      "end_ms": 64300,
      "start_frame": 1771,
      "end_frame": 1929,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "The code is simple.",
      "start_ms": 64940,
      "end_ms": 66100,
      "start_frame": 1948,
      "end_frame": 1983,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "One pass to count, and one pass to rewrite.",
      "start_ms": 66600,
      "end_ms": 70440,
      "start_frame": 1998,
      "end_frame": 2113,
      "word_count": 9
    }
  ],
